**Location:** Georgetown, TX

## Job Description

Advanced 1

We are seeking an experienced Sr. Fiber Design Engineer to join our growing team. This role is pivotal in driving high-quality fiber optic network designs that meet client specifications and industry standards.

**Responsibilities:**
- Lead fiber design projects from conception to delivery, ensuring adherence to specifications and standards
