- Strong understanding of fiber optic network design principles
- Knowledge of permitting processes and requirements for telecom infrastructure
- Familiarity with OSP design standards and specifications
- Ability to manage multiple projects and meet deadlines

**Compensation:** $80,000 - $110,000 annually

**Job Type:** Full-time

